        "reviewer": "Codex targeted independent A",
        "reason": "Own v2 whole-P scientific judgment retained after explicit current comparison; 25 exact unchanged scientific case bodies retained, 3 changed bilingual bodies actually reviewed. Exact unchanged current scientific cases retained. BY GA/EA8.2 combines spatial redox with work from measurements. Actual f093 owns structure, electrode reactions and qualitative voltage; current 96fd owns loaded U/I/t work, time intervals, open-circuit limit and thermodynamic boundaries. These are genuine distinct bounded components, and no missing new component is identified for the work goal. Do not claim actual laboratory execution. AI-authored synthetic E1/G1 candidate, no learner execution or human attestation.",
        "evidenceLevel": "E1",
