        "reason": "DE: Exakter Autorenprofilkörper für normalen Byte-/Schemaabgleich; mein eigenständiges fachliches Urteil einschließlich aller Holds steht in FINAL.targeted29.genuine-scientific-judgments.json. EN: Exact author profile body retained for normal binding validation; independent scientific judgments and holds are recorded separately. No human approval or learner performance is claimed.",
        "evidenceLevel": "E1",
