      "originalReviewId": "chemie-equilibrium16-final-native-independent-a-p-20261015-v1",
      "originalScienceReasonRetainedOnlyHereNotInCleanInput": "642d5ea5 — suitable existing material, E1/G1.** Cases 03-a/b cover coupled anodic/cathodic processes, correct oxygen-reduction balance, coating damage, contact continuity and differential aeration. They require causal explanation, not an E° ranking alone. The changed acidic cathode and impressed-current conditions test transfer; passivation and kinetic limits prevent unsupported protection-rate claims. Partner goals retain full economic/ecological judgment and dedicated acid/oxygen classification.",
